    {
      "path": "/summary",
      "value": "Engineering Leader with 15+ years in CloudOps, DevOps, and, SRE, leading teams of up to 40+ engineers and delivering 99.99% uptime for global SaaS platforms. Proven record in multi-cloud architecture, automation, and large-scale distributed systems, delivering 30% cost savings and accelerating release cycles from weeks to hours. Proven 8-year track record in engineering leadership, delivering large-scale cloud and automation initiatives with measurable business impact. Extensive expertise in DevOps practices and SRE principles, delivering high-availability, resilient, and scalable systems. Proficient in multi-cloud environments including AWS, GCP, Azure, and Oracle Cloud, with hands-on experience in architecture, migration, and optimization. Skilled in DevOps toolchains such as Git/GitHub, Jenkins, Docker, and Kubernetes for CI/CD automation and container orchestration. Experienced in enterprise monitoring and observability solutions including Datadog, AppDynamics, Prometheus, and Zabbix for proactive incident prevention. Recognized trainer and mentor in Oracle WebLogic, Cloud, and DevOps, enabling team upskilling and knowledge transfer across global teams. Strong leadership in strategic planning and governance, driving enterprise cloud strategy, IT compliance, stakeholder alignment, and global delivery excellence.",
